{"id":325285,"bangumiId":325285,"type":2,"name":"オッドタクシー","name_cn":"奇巧计程车","date":"2021-04-05","year":"2021","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/65/90/325285_4688X.jpg"},"summary":"明明是熟悉的街道，这座城市却似乎有哪里变得不太一样了。\r\n出租车司机小户川每天平凡度日。他没有亲人，鲜少与人交流，是个有点孤僻木讷的怪人。兴趣是在睡前听落语和工作时听广播。姑且能称得上是他朋友的人，只有他的主治医生刚力，以及高中同学柿花而已。\r\n他载到的尽是些有点古怪的客人：一心想在网路上被疯传的大学生，桦泽；似乎有所隐情的护理师，白川；不太红的搞笑二人组，智人拍档；街头无赖，阴沟；正要开始走红的偶像女团，神秘之吻等。\r\n人与人之间百无聊赖的对话，最后竟与一位失踪少女扯上了关系。","rating":{"rank":41,"total":22342,"count":{"1":32,"2":18,"3":18,"4":29,"5":98,"6":417,"7":1877,"8":7390,"9":9539,"10":2924},"score":8.5},"collection":{"on_hold":877,"dropped":245,"wish":7444,"collect":33750,"doing":1896},"tags":[{"name":"原创","count":6316,"total_count":637655},{"name":"悬疑","count":6166,"total_count":117138},{"name":"群像","count":4319,"total_count":13220},{"name":"2021年4月","count":2698,"total_count":25966},{"name":"TV","count":2359,"total_count":1450216},{"name":"推理","count":2326,"total_count":75723},{"name":"剧情","count":2287,"total_count":16507},{"name":"P.I.C.S.","count":1783,"total_count":1892},{"name":"动物","count":1702,"total_count":6310},{"name":"2021","count":1343,"total_count":80635},{"name":"OLM","count":788,"total_count":13150},{"name":"木下麦","count":547,"total_count":685},{"name":"神作","count":405,"total_count":48416},{"name":"日本","count":379,"total_count":316919},{"name":"此元和津也","count":334,"total_count":417},{"name":"日本动画","count":154,"total_count":36240},{"name":"木村良平","count":56,"total_count":3011},{"name":"2021年","count":50,"total_count":3713},{"name":"奇巧计程车","count":38,"total_count":46},{"name":"都市","count":38,"total_count":795},{"name":"奇幻","count":33,"total_count":494159},{"name":"日常","cou